        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</title>\n<script>\n  window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$'], ['\\\\(','\\\\)']], displayMath: [['$$','$$'], ['\\\\[','\\\\]']] } };\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Oswald:wght@400;500&family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@400&display=swap');\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fff; }\n  body { width: 816px; min-height: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; color: #fff; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', Arial, sans-serif; }\n  .title-band { height: 116px; background: #6964a8; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center; padding: 0 80px; }\n  h1, h2 { font-family: 'Oswald', 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif; font-weight: 400; margin: 0; }\n  h1 { font-size: 37px; line-height: 1.08; }\n  h2 { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.1; }\n  .content { width: 712px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .section { position: relative; }\n  .purpose { height: 218px; background: #61b8ca; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 47% 53%; align-items: center; padding: 0 38px; }\n  .hypothesis { height: 168px; background: #7772be; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 47% 53%; align-items: center; padding: 0 38px; }\n  .method-results { height: 387px; background: #61b8ca; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 50% 50%; padding: 23px 39px 30px; column-gap: 24px; }\n  .text-block { min-width: 0; }\n  p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.48; margin: 13px 0 0; }\n  .method-results p { margin-top: 12px; }\n  .method-results .text-block + .text-block { padding-left: 0; }\n  .shelf { height: 49px; position: relative; background: #5cabbc; margin: 0 -16px; }\n  .shelf:before { content: ''; position: absolute; top: -21px; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 21px; background: #70d0df; clip-path: polygon(3% 0, 97% 0, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }\n  .shelf.purple { background: #625ca8; }\n  .shelf.purple:before { background: #918ce0; }\n  .illustration { height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n  .placeholder { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: transparent; font-size: 1px; }\n  .purpose-art { width: 250px; height: 160px; }\n  .purpose-art:before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 76px; height: 76px; left: 9px; top: 31px; background: #3ead4e; transform: rotate(45deg); border-radius: 13px; }\n  .purpose-art:after { content: '$'; position: absolute; left: 35px; top: 43px; color: #fff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 66px; font-weight: bold; z-index: 2; }\n  .bottle, .pill-bottle { position: absolute; border-radius: 10px 10px 12px 12px; }\n  .bottle { width: 91px; height: 108px; left: 88px; top: 52px; background: #45478a; border: 13px solid #3e3f79; }\n  .bottle:before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 41px; height: 61px; left: 11px; top: 18px; background: #f7f7f7; }\n  .bottle:after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 26px; height: 10px; left: 18px; top: 26px; background: #ef4d4a; box-shadow: 0 17px 0 #a9a9a9, 0 34px 0 #a9a9a9, 0 49px 0 #a9a9a9; }\n  .pill-bottle { width: 66px; height: 102px; right: 19px; top: 53px; background: #4db67d; border: 0; overflow: hidden; }\n  .pill-bottle:before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 66px; height: 25px; background: #b32e34; border-radius: 7px 7px 0 0; box-shadow: inset 0 -9px 0 #a7242c, inset 0 0 0 6px #c6383d; }\n  .pill-bottle:after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 44px; width: 66px; height: 15px; background: #138d51; box-shadow: 0 42px 0 #28a95f; }\n  .pill { position: absolute; left: 27px; top: 65px; width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 11px solid transparent; border-right: 11px solid transparent; border-top: 31px solid #ffd12d; z-index: 2; }\n  .cap { position: absolute; width: 72px; height: 27px; top: 25px; left: 99px; border-radius: 9px; background: #ffae19; box-shadow: inset 0 -7px 0 #f7a111, inset 8px 0 #ffc022, inset 20px 0 #ffc022, inset 32px 0 #ffc022, inset 44px 0 #ffc022, inset 56px 0 #ffc022; z-index: 3; }\n  .hypothesis-art { width: 250px; height: 135px; }\n  .capsules { position: absolute; left: 84px; top: 13px; width: 75px; height: 122px; }\n  .capsules:before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 75px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ffc51b; box-shadow: 0 24px 0 #ffbd18, 0 48px 0 #ffc51b, 0 72px 0 #ffbd18, 0 96px 0 #ffc51b; }\n  .capsules:after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 12px; width: 75px; height: 15px; background: #f99e16; border-radius: 0 0 50% 50%; box-shadow: 0 24px 0 #f99e16, 0 48px 0 #f99e16, 0 72px 0 #f99e16, 0 96px 0 #f99e16; }\n  .green-box { position: absolute; right: 21px; top: 26px; width: 55px; height: 94px; background: #168d0c; border: 10px solid #178d0c; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #42af22; }\n  .green-box:after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 5px; top: 25px; width: 27px; height: 27px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; }\n  .capsule { position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 34px; width: 88px; height: 38px; border-radius: 24px; transform: rotate(45deg); background: linear-gradient(90deg, #14bccc 0 48%, #eb1d5b 48%); box-shadow: inset 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,.25); }\n  .results-art { position: absolute; right: 40px; bottom: -14px; width: 220px; height: 120px; }\n  .red-document { position: absolute; right: 92px; bottom: 0; width: 110px; height: 78px; background: #ed4144; border-radius: 8px; }\n  .red-document:before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 28px; top: 25px; width: 40px; height: 38px; background: #fff; clip-path: polygon(0 0, 65% 0, 100% 35%, 100% 100%, 0 100%); }\n  .green-document { position: absolute; right: 0; bottom: 0; width: 83px; height: 111px; background: #40b879; border-radius: 7px; border: 10px solid #159c66; }\n  .green-document:before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 13px; width: 42px; height: 76px; background: #eee; box-shadow: inset 0 13px #aaa, inset 0 28px #bbb, inset 0 43px #bbb, inset 0 58px #bbb; }\n  .green-document:after { content: '+'; position: absolute; right: 4px; bottom: 9px; color: #ee4845; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .footer { height: 55px; color: #6964a8; position: relative; padding: 13px 0 0; }\n  .footer .logo { font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-size: 38px; letter-spacing: 4px; line-height: 1; }\n  .credits { position: absolute; left: 151px; top: 14px; color: #5aaec0; font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.35; }\n  .credits strong { color: #6964a8; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"title-band\">\n    <h1>The Placebo Effect: Are Expensive Placebos<br>More Effective Than Cheap Placebos?</h1>\n  </header>\n  <main class=\"content\">\n    <section class=\"section purpose\">\n      <div class=\"illustration\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder purpose-art\" aria-label=\"Illustration: money sign, medicine bottle, and pill bottle\">\n          [Illustration: money sign, medicine bottle, and pill bottle]\n          <span class=\"cap\"></span><span class=\"bottle\"></span><span class=\"pill-bottle\"></span><span class=\"pill\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h2>Purpose</h2>\n        <p>In what ways can fictitious costs impact the effectiveness<br>of a placebo? To better understand how the ‘placebo<br>effect’ takes place, we will provide placebos of different<br>reported costs and measure their impact on the patients.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"shelf\"></div>\n    <section class=\"section hypothesis\">\n      <div class=\"illustration\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder hypothesis-art\" aria-label=\"Illustration: capsule, stacked coins, and medicine box\">\n          [Illustration: capsule, stacked coins, and medicine box]\n          <span class=\"capsule\"></span><span class=\"capsules\"></span><span class=\"green-box\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h2>Hypothesis</h2>\n        <p>Providing placebos that are ‘expensive’ will amplify the<br>placebo effect of actual placebos with participants.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"shelf purple\"></div>\n    <section class=\"section method-results\">\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h2>Method</h2>\n        <p>Participants suffering from Parkinson’s Disease serve as<br>placebo effect test subjects.</p>\n        <p>Each participant receives an effective drug valued at $100<br>per dose and then motor function changes are measured.<br>After each participant receives an effective drug said to be<br>valued at $1500 per dose, then their motor functions are<br>measured again.</p>\n        <p>A comparison between motor function improvements<br>following the administration of each placebo will help<br>determine whether fictitious costs can influence the<br>effectiveness of a placebo.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-block\">\n        <h2>Results</h2>\n        <p>The study found motor functions improve significantly<br>more for participants following the administration of a<br>reportedly $1500 placebo, compared to a reportedly<br>$100 placebo.</p>\n        <p>While the degree of improvement in motor function for<br>participants varied due to the administration of a $1500<br>placebo drug, all participants experienced improved<br>motor functions. A higher cost for a placebo will improve<br>patients’ conditions even more.</p>\n        <div class=\"placeholder results-art\" aria-label=\"Illustration: red and green medicine packages\">\n          [Illustration: red and green medicine packages]\n          <span class=\"red-document\"></span><span class=\"green-document\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <div class=\"shelf\"></div>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">M.I.S.H.B</div>\n      <div class=\"credits\"><strong>Study by Janelle Mauricio, Vanessa Garby, Shyvinder Singh - The Massy Institute for Studies of Human Behavior</strong><br>References: Kemputo, Odelle., “The psychology of self-deception” The Anaptic Journal, 2017 // Sada, Evan., Temitope, Andrew., “Neuroscience of<br>Decision-Making” The Science Review, 2018 // Brahms, Hansen., Leigh, Anderson., “The Need and Neurology for Happiness”, The Arch Journal, 2020</div>\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
